# The bare test_*.py rule above also matches tests/test_*.py at any depth (gitignore
# patterns with no leading/embedded slash match every directory level). The six
# !exceptions above are root-level filenames and do NOT reach into tests/, so this
# was silently excluding the entire tests/ suite from version control. Track it
# explicitly going forward.
!tests/test_*.py
